<title>USA: TABLE-BioWhittaker Q3 net income vs loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE-BioWhittaker Q3 net income vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>WALKERSVILLE, Md. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>BioWhittaker Inc</p>
<p>			  For the Three Months  For the Nine Months</p>
<p>			  Ended July31		  Ended July 31,</p>
<p>			1997	  1996	    1997	   1996</p>
<p>Sales	    $14,322	$12,253	$42,254	$37,724</p>
<p>Income From Operations</p>
<p>		    2,536	  1,982	  7,108	  5,523</p>
<p>Litigation expenses</p>
<p>		     ---	   300	     ---	   3,500</p>
<p>Legal settlement(315)	  ---	    (315)	     ---</p>
<p>Net Income/(Loss)</p>
<p>		    1,919	  (910)	   4,886	 (1,502)</p>
<p>Net Income/(Loss) Per Share</p>
<p>		    0.17	   (0.08)	  0.45	  (0.14)</p>
<p>Average common and common equivalent shares outstanding</p>
<p>(in thousands) 11,021	 10,759	 10,944	  10,759</p>
<p>	     (Dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: -- Company reported Q3 operating income at $0.16 a share or $1,725,000 versus $0.13 a share or $1,377,000 during the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Co says both Q3 and first nine months results included a $194,000 after tax gain associated with settlement of an appeal pending in its litigation with Minnesota Mining and Manufacturing (3M).</p>
